<title>USA: Bombay Co January same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Bombay Co January same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$22.8	$26.7	+ 9.0</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $336.3     $330.7	+ 2.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended   Feb 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Sales for January 1996 were for a five week period.</p>
<p>Sales for fiscal 1997 were for a 52 week period as compared to sales for fiscal 1996 for a 53 week period.</p>
</text>
